{"id":"i1miu21fci4mlbdihlkg6jh2h","title":"接受困境：中文名字没有中文缩写","originalTitle":"中文名字没有中文缩写：接受困境","summary":"依据国家标准，中文名字的缩写只能体现在汉语拼音上，无法用中文缩写。这导致中文作品只能使用全名，无法简化称呼。作者认为，虽然聪明的中国人通过笔名解决了部分问题，但本质上缩写与笔名是不同的概念，中文名字的缩写困境无法完全避免。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=3519678&do=blog&id=1560760"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T11:12:52.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-12T00:45:19.485Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-12T00:45:19.485Z","category":null,"tags":["论文发表"],"score":28,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"ebe0bdb6-f2f6-41cd-900b-69433c582ad9","title":"接受困境：中文名字无中文缩写引发学术文献命名争议"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"ebe0bdb6-f2f6-41cd-900b-69433c582ad9","title":"接受困境：中文名字无中文缩写引发学术文献命名争议"}],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fvjbeoI5rRlE","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}